            <scopecontent id="aspace_a05b0c9372e9296274ab653704dbb5a9">
               <head>Scope and Contents</head>
               <p>A 1977 statement written by Herman W. Liebert on his observations of Charles A. Lindbergh's personality. Liebert says he observed Lindbergh playing mean-spirited practical jokes intended to embarrass others and observed he had a "need to command."</p>
            </scopecontent>
